WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:01.920
Second son, second son

00:02.200 --> 00:03.600
You've grown up

00:03.840 --> 00:06.507
And not a word of truth to me

00:06.600 --> 00:08.600
How many heads fell last night

00:08.960 --> 00:10.520
I'm not yet blind

00:10.600 --> 00:12.000
Or deaf

00:15.920 --> 00:17.320
Go see your mother

00:18.320 --> 00:18.760
Father

00:18.840 --> 00:20.160
You're not young anymore

00:20.240 --> 00:21.840
It's time to go to your fief

00:27.500 --> 00:41.500
Three days later, the Emperor issued an imperial edict assigning the northern border region of Dingzhou as the Prince of Jin's fief, ordering you to take up your post on an auspicious day.
